  "title": "Stop Underestimating How Long Tasks Will Take",
  "description": "Stop underestimating how long tasks will take. Here’s how: - Add buffer time: Whatever you think a task will take, add 50% more time. - Use past experience: Look back at similar tasks and note how long they actually took. - Break it down: Split tasks into smaller steps and estimate each one individually. Example: If you think writing a report will take 2 hours, plan for 3 and include time for editing and interruptions.",
